<overview>
<p>The Free Worlds League Military has long fielded some of the largest infantry formations in the Inner Sphere, with regiments numbering nearly 1,800 soldiers compared to roughly 750 in the Combine and just over 1,000 in the Federated Suns. Towing crew-served light autocannon/5, these platoons carry compact weapons that trade raw stopping power for improved portability, allowing faster redeployment between firing positions than standard-weight field guns.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on common production date of light autocannon
